<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea crude oil runs rise 8 pct in July yr/yr.</title>
<headline>S.Korea crude oil runs rise 8 pct in July yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's crude oil processing increased eight percent to 60.53 million barrels in July from 55.81 million barrels a year earlier, the Korea Petroleum Association (KPA) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>South Korean refiners' licensed crude processing capacity stood at 2.02 million on barrels per day (bpd) in July versus 1.82 million bpd a year ago. (In million barrels unless stated)</p>
<p>		     July 96   June 96    July 95   Jan-July 96</p>
<p>Crude Runs	 60.53     49.46	 55.81	 392.82</p>
<p>Util. Rate(%P)   96.76     81.69	 99.02	  94.01</p>
<p>Inventory	  10.11     11.96	 11.81	  10.11</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
